    "title": "About the Unleashed set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Unleashed is a HeartGold & SoulSilver expansion released on 12 May 2010. It has 96 cards: 95 in the main set and 1 secret rare. There are also 83 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 95 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (178 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 179 cards, adding the 1 secret rare).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
